assed the old control, and passing a mis-aimed control does not invalidate a measurement. What is withdrawn is one interpretive sentence in the M85 docstring, that the control measures the scorer rather than the split, and the withdrawal is disclosed in the write-up. This is a narrowing, which N87.1 permits, and it revises no sealed number.","N90.1.6 - the old class-block control is retained alongside the repaired one and both are reported for every arm, so the size of the class-block effect stays on the record rather than being deleted from it. Validity is decided on the repaired control alone.","N90.1.7 - every registered judgement of M90 that this milestone does not explicitly reopen is carried unchanged: N90.2 through N90.9 as written, the standing floor of 10 fit samples per fitted tangent dimension, R5 nulls, and the rule that an arm failing its instrument is void rather than negative.","N90.1.8 - the stratified split is drawn once from a seed fixed before execution. It is not redrawn, and no arm is re-read under a second draw."],"replication":{"deltas":{"baseline":{"acceptance_multiplicity.mean":0.0,"auroc.auroc":0.0,"known_accuracy":0.0,"negative_control_class_block":0.0,"positive_control":0.0,"rejection_recall.rejection_recall":0.0},"cosine":{"acceptance_multiplicity.mean":0.0,"auroc.auroc":0.0,"known_accuracy":0.0,"negative_control_class_block":0.0,"positive_control":0.0,"rejection_recall.rejection_recall":0.0},"domain_centred":{"acceptance_multiplicity.mean":0.0,"auroc.auroc":0.0,"known_accuracy":0.0,"negative_control_class_block":0.0,"positive_control":0.0,"rejection_recall.rejection_recall":0.0},"domain_centred_null":{"acceptance_multiplicity.mean":0.0,"auroc.auroc":0.0,"known_accuracy":0.0,"negative_control_class_block":0.0,"positive_control":0.0,"rejection_recall.rejection_recall":0.0},"domain_mixture":{"acceptance_multiplicity.mean":0.0,"auroc.auroc":0.0,"known_accuracy":0.0,"negative_control_class_block":0.0,"positive_control":0.0,"rejection_recall.